      <activity id="0e414db9-b6ae-594b-8845-e5c95ed9918c" activityNameId="1c7a3165-0d8c-54c6-9fe2-51a034939327" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Disposal, building, door, outer, wood-aluminium, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Disposal, building, door, outer, wood-aluminium, to final disposal
The dataset can be applied for a standard outer door (wood-aluminium) disposal process in Switzerland. ;
UUID: 4f856f2b-f345-4295-b2b1-1389d454b41b
The dataset describes the disposal of a wood-aluminium outer door in a municipal incineration. The door frame out of steel is recycled at 100%. The rest of the materials (rest of steel parts, aluminium, rubber, plastics, mortar, paints and wood) is disposed in a municipal solid waste incineration.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The technology in this dataset represents standard incineration technology in Europe. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Calculation from waste composition 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f856f2b-f345-4295-b2b1-1389d454b41b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
